    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my back has been killing me since i tripped yesterday. i've been on zoloft for like 2 years now for my anxiety/depression and it's been fine, but i have some tramadol left over from a few years ago. is it okay if i take one of those for the pain or will they mess with each other?",
